<P>(b) For modernization projects the limits of state funding assistance is 1.5 times the amount calculated for new construction.</P>
<P>(c) For those projects which include a combination of new construction and modernization, the limits of state participation must be prorated as set forth in (a) and (b) of this subsection.</P>
